# The Mercenary's ability is "Activate only as a sorcery" (CR 602.5d): on turn 3 at the beginning of combat the untapped token cannot activate, and
# in the main phase with the stack empty it may target itself (its source is not the ability, CR 115.5), becoming 2/1 until end of turn.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Prickly Pair
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Prickly Pair.Cast
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
! Bot1.Battlefield.Mercenary Token.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Prickly Pair)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mercenary Token.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Mercenary Token)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mercenary Token.Power = 2
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mercenary Token.Toughness = 1
? Bot1.Battlefield.Prickly Pair.Power = 2

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Prickly Pair.Power = 2
